# Frontend (Vite exposes only VITE_-prefixed vars to the browser).
# Base URL of the deployed Supabase Edge Functions for this project, e.g.
# https://<project-ref>.supabase.co/functions/v1
# Find <project-ref> in the Supabase dashboard: Project Settings -> General.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=

# Everything below is used by Supabase Edge Functions, not the frontend build.
# SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_ANON_KEY, SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY and SUPABASE_DB_URL
# are injected automatically into every deployed Edge Function by Supabase -
# do not set them here and do not put the service role key in this file.

# Secrets an Edge Function needs beyond what Supabase injects automatically
# are set with `npx supabase secrets set NAME=value`, never committed here.
# Used by supabase/functions/_shared/email.ts (Brevo's HTTP API - not their
# SMTP relay, which Supabase Edge Functions can't reach directly) - without
# these, that function just logs emails to the function's console instead
# of sending. Find the API key in the Brevo dashboard under
# SMTP & API -> API Keys tab.
# BREVO_API_KEY=
# EMAIL_FROM=      # must be a sender address verified in the Brevo account
